  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Technical support to development partners within the portfolio addressing climate change</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The purpose of the assignment is to provide support and guidance to development partners for the financial and administrative closure of development projects within a portfolio addressing climate change and environment challenges at the international and local level. The assignment will also serve to assess current financial management practices and their adequacies with requirements for transparency and accountability. Finally, an aim is to document results achieved and ensure that these are shared for future improvement of project designs.</narrative>
  </description>
